0:29.568" end="00:29.830">my </span><span begin="00:29.830" end="00:31.349">telephone</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.783" end="00:35.791"><span begin="00:32.783" end="00:32.957">You're </span><span begin="00:32.957" end="00:33.843">running </span><span begin="00:33.843" end="00:34.129">through </span><span begin="00:34.129" end="00:34.617">my </span><span begin="00:34.617" end="00:35.791">head</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.043" end="00:45.084"><span begin="00:41.043" end="00:41.247">We </span><span begin="00:41.247" end="00:41.589">used </span><span begin="00:41.589" end="00:41.817">to </span><span begin="00:41.817" end="00:42.182">stay </span><span begin="00:42.182" end="00:42.479">up </span><span begin="00:42.479" end="00:42.762">for </span><span begin="00:42.762" end="00:43.609">hours </span><span begin="00:43.609" end="00:44.231">many </span><span begin="00:44.231" end="00:45.084">nights</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.411" end="00:48.310"><span begin="00:45.411" end="00:45.798">Fussing </span><span begin="00:45.798" end="00:45.960">and </span><span begin="00:45.960" end="00:47.415">fighting ******* </span><span begin="00:47.415" end="00:47.611">and </span><span begin="00:47.611" end="00:48.310">lying</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.790" end="00:51.717"><span begin="00:48.790" end="00:49.014">Nights </span><span begin="00:49.014" end="00:49.180">in </span><span begin="00:49.180" end="00:50.266">Miami </span><span begin="00:50.266" end="00:50.510">tears </span><span begin="00:50.510" end="00:50.658">at </span><span begin="00:50.658" end="00:50.826">the </span><span begin="00:50.826" end="00:51.717">Grammy</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.789" end="00:55.198"><span begin="00:51.789" end="00:52.017">I </span><span begin="00:52.017" end="00:52.164">just </span><span begin="00:52.164" end="00:52.320">wanna </span><span begin="00:52.320" end="00:54.299">thank </span><span begin="00:54.299" end="00:55.198">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.440" end="01:00.566"><span begin="00:57.440" end="00:57.634">For </span><span begin="00:57.634" end="00:58.549">being </span><span begin="00:58.549" end="00:58.933">my </span><span begin="00:58.933" end="01:00.566">mirror</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.687" end="01:03.176"><span begin="01:00.687" end="01:01.407">Showing </span><span begin="01:01.407" end="01:01.751">me </span><span begin="01:01.751" end="01:03.176">myself</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.912" end="01:08.439"><span begin="01:04.912" end="01:05.081">I </span><span begin="01:05.081" end="01:05.260">just </span><span begin="01:05.260" end="01:05.570">wanna </span><span begin="01:05.570" end="01:07.418">thank </span><span begin="01:07.418" end="01:08.439">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.485" end="01:16.942"><span begin="01:10.485" end="01:10.669">You </span><span begin="01:10.669" end="01:11.063">helped </span><span begin="01:11.063" end="01:11.619">me </span><span begin="01:11.619" end="01:11.853">see </span><span begin="01:11.853" end="01:13.625">clearer </span><span begin="01:13.801" end="01:13.979">like </span><span begin="01:13.979" end="01:15.131">nobody </span><span begin="01:15.131" end="01:16.942">else</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.481" end="01:24.111"><span begin="01:20.481" end="01:20.848">Now </span><span begin="01:20.848" end="01:21.109">that </span><span begin="01:21.109" end="01:21.373">the </span><span begin="01:21.373" end="01:22.157">feeling </span><span begin="01:22.157" end="01:22.352">has </span><span begin="01:22.352" end="01:22.824">floated </span><span begin="01:22.824" end="01:24.111">away</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.170" end="01:28.557"><span begin="01:25.170" end="01:25.336">And </span><span begin="01:25.336" end="01:25.474">I </span><span begin="01:25.474" end="01:25.915">got </span><span begin="01:25.915" end="01:26.091">a </span><span begin="01:26.091" end="01:26.253">bit </span><span begin="01:26.253" end="01:26.404">of </span><span begin="01:26.404" end="01:28.557">clarity</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.668" end="01:37.160"><span begin="01:33.668" end="01:34.455">Addicts </span><span begin="01:34.455" end="01:34.711">are </span><span begin="01:34.711" end="01:35.211">addicts </span><span begin="01:35.211" end="01:35.419">and </span><span begin="01:35.419" end="01:35.901">will </span><span begin="01:35.901" end="01:36.130">never </span><span begin="01:36.130" end="01:37.160">change</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.542" end="01:41.730"><span begin="01:38.542" end="01:38.733">But </span><span begin="01:38.733" end="01:38.967">we </span><span begin="01:38.967" end="01:39.175">were </span><span begin="01:39.175" end="01:39.419">never </span><span begin="01:39.419" end="01:39.961">scared </span><span begin="01:39.961" end="01:40.117">to </span><span begin="01:40.117" end="01:41.730">be</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.921" end="01:50.893"><span begin="01:46.921" end="01:47.097">Get </span><span begin="01:47.097" end="01:47.393">it </span><span begin="01:47.393" end="01:47.620">all </span><span begin="01:47.620" end="01:48.025">out </span><span begin="01:48.025" end="01:48.249">my </span><span begin="01:48.249" end="01:49.357">system </span><span begin="01:49.674" end="01:49.912">by </span><span begin="01:49.912" end="01:50.160">God's </span><span begin="01:50.160" end="01:50.893">grace</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.973" end="01:54.133"><span begin="01:50.973" end="01:51.157">I'll </span><span begin="01:51.157" end="01:51.374">never </span><span begin="01:51.374" end="01:51.844">regret </span><span begin="01:51.844" end="01:52.498">you </span><span begin="01:52.498" end="01:52.701">it's </span><span begin="01:52.701" end="01:53.038">Heaven </span><span begin="01:53.038" end="01:53.256">that </span><span begin="01:53.256" end="01:53.483">sent </span><span begin="01:53.483" end="01:54.133">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.371" end="01:57.477"><span begin="01:54.371" end="01:54.545">I'll </span><span begin="01:54.545" end="01:54.764">never </span><span begin="01:54.764" end="01:55.239">go </span><span begin="01:55.239" end="01:55.776">back </span><span begin="01:55.776" end="01:55.973">I </span><span begin="01:55.973" end="01:56.168">hope </span><span begin="01:56.168" end="01:56.373">that </span><span begin="01:56.373" end="01:56.554">you </span><span begin="01:56.554" end="01:56.876">know </span><span begin="01:56.876" end="01:57.477">that</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.477" end="02:01.081"><span begin="01:57.477" end="01:57.708">I </span><span begin="01:57.708" end="01:57.912">just </span><span begin="01:57.912" end="01:58.125">wanna </span><span begin="01:58.125" end="02:00.082">thank </span><span begin="02:00.082" end="02:01.081">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.252" end="02:06.367"><span begin="02:03.252" end="02:03.405">For </span><span begin="02:03.405" end="02:03.958">being </span><span begin="02:03.958" end="02:04.681">my </span><span begin="02:04.681" end="02:06.367">mirror</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.484" end="02:08.904"><span begin="02:06.484" end="02:07.136">Showing </span><span begin="02:07.136" end="02:07.507">me </span><span begin="02:07.507" end="02:08.904">myself</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.587" end="02:14.213"><span begin="02:10.587" end="02:10.823">I </span><span begin="02:10.823" end="02:10.988">just </span><span begin="02:10.988" end="02:11.342">wanna </span><span begin="02:11.342" end="02:13.060">thank </span><span begin="02:13.060" end="02:14.213">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.241" end="02:22.758"><span begin="02:16.241" end="02:16.443">You </span><span begin="02:16.443" end="02:16.875">helped </span><span begin="02:16.875" end="02:17.069">me </span><span begin="02:17.069" end="02:17.593">see </span><span begin="02:17.593" end="02:19.282">clearer </span><span begin="02:19.560" end="02:19.773">like </span><span begin="02:19.773" end="02:21.065">nobody </span><span begin="02:21.065" end="02:22.758">else</span></p></div></body></tt>